Third-party components
----------------------

The Volta build links against or derives from the following projects. Each
remains under its own license and copyright; consult each project for terms.
None of them are redistributed in this repository — the build scripts fetch
them at pinned revisions.

  marlin_v100 — SM70 Marlin GPTQ/AWQ kernels
    https://github.com/zhinianqin/marlin_v100

  1Cat-vLLM — source of the SM70 TurboMind block-FP8 / FP16 MoE backend
    https://github.com/1CatAI/1Cat-vLLM

  NVIDIA CUTLASS
    https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass
    Copyright (c) NVIDIA Corporation

  FlashInfer (patched for sm70; see patches/flashinfer-sm70.patch)
    https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer

  TileLang — the sm70 attention and GDN kernels build on TileLang
    https://github.com/tile-ai/tilelang

Patches under patches/ are modifications to the above projects, distributed
under this repository's Apache 2.0 license, and are only meaningful when applied
to the upstream sources they name.

